{{Quote|She's in the dome in Governor Pryce's office.''"<br />"''The administrative offices will be on the 157th level. D block.|Ezra Bridger and Sabine Wren discussing the location of the captured Hera Syndulla|<ref name="Jedi Night" />}}
The '''157th level''' of [[Lothal]]'s [[Imperial Complex (Lothal)|Imperial dome]] housed the [[Imperial Planetary Occupation Facility|complex's]] administrative offices, including [[Governor of the Lothal sector|Governor]] [[Arihnda Pryce]]'s [[Pryce's office|office]], which was found in [[Block D|D block]]. After Pryce captured [[Hera Syndulla]] during the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]]'s failed [[attack on Lothal]], she was restrained on an [[interrogation chair]] in Pryce's office for questioning. While she was restrained, Pryce gave her pulses of electroshock and [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] questioned her about her [[Syndulla Kalikori|family's]] [[Kalikori]], noting that through his study of the artwork, he determined that she had a [[Hera Syndulla's brother|brother]] who [[Death|died]] when he was in his youth.<ref name="Jedi Night" />

